  "notes": "Material 3-style tonal palette built on a teal seed (#006a6a primary, #aedcdb secondary container for the selected 'My Library' node and the selected tag/row). The top bar and toolbar are grouped as light gray (#f2f5f4) pill clusters of circular line-icon buttons. Rows are tall (~49px) with hairline dividers and no zebra striping; notes, journal articles, books and web pages are told apart by small line type icons in the first column. Tags are outlined pill chips with colored dots for priority tags (red to-read, orange important, green own work, blue, purple) plus a count and an inline rename pencil. Collection names truncate with an ellipsis. Clicking a row narrows the table and opens a rounded right-hand detail card with an editable field list (item type select, draggable author rows, abstract). This was verified live but is not visible in the capture."
